# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CAREVERSE client environment
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ reach the browser. Never put a secret
# here -- anything in this file is shipped to the client.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Leave unset in development: the Vite dev server proxies /api/* to the
# FastAPI server (see vite.config.ts), so no CORS config is needed.
#
# Set this in production to the deployed API base, e.g.
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.careverse.example.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
